<title>UK: UK manufacturing down 0.5% in Nov.</title>
<headline>UK manufacturing down 0.5% in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics (ONS) released the following seasonally adjusted data on UK industrial production in November:</p>
<p>    MANUFACTURING OUTPUT	    NOV     OCT	(PREL OCT)</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	   -0.5    +0.5     (+0.5)</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	     +0.2    +0.5     (+0.5)</p>
<p>    3-mth/3-mth change		+0.4    +0.4     (+0.4)</p>
<p>    3-mth/3-mth year ago change   +0.3    +0.1     (+0.1)</p>
<p>    Index (Base 1990)		 102.2   102.7   (102.6)</p>
<p>INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change in pct  +0.4    unch     (UNCH)</p>
</text>
